  "description": "Shared contracts for CQRSharp: command, query, stream, and notification markers, handler interfaces, pipeline and validation attribute contracts, and exception-hook, idempotency, and outbox abstractions. Reference this to define handlers without depending on the full runtime.",
  "iconFile": "CQRSharp_Icon.png",
