  "published": "2026-06-30T19:21:32.597Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.1.0. Ships the new ease-of-use analyzers (no API change): CQRA011 (custom context without a factory), CQRA012 (validator declared but validation not enabled), CQRA013 (request not opted into a configured behavior), CQRA014 (direct AddCqrs misuse, with a code fix), and CQRA017 (collapse a pre+post pair to ICommandInterceptor), plus the CQRGEN010 generator diagnostic. Adds the CqrsRegisteredContextFactory assembly marker that lets CQRA011 see factories across assemblies, and the outcome-aware post-handler types (RequestOutcome, IPostHandlerOutcomeAware, OutcomeAwarePostHandlerAttribute) for post-handlers that classify on the value the handler returned or the exception it threw.",
